	(text "J6 port 1 = Pi Zero 2 (host). The board powers the Pi through VBUS1.\nJ6 port 2 = camera, VBUS through F2 0.75A PTC (VBUS_CAM).\nU2 downstream2 -> U3 CH340C -> ESP32 UART0.\nRoute D+/D- as 90 ohm pairs; U10/U11 next to J6 (pads 1-6 / 3-4 flow-through).\nY1 + C23/C24 close to U2. C13 C14 C21 C22 C44-C46 at U2 supply pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.4 112 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82061342-689a-4d20-b6e9-bf7a8689e25f")
	)
